                  "type": "math",
                  "latex": "\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3}{4}\\div\\frac{7}{12}&=\\frac{\\boxed{\\rule{0pt}{5mm}\\hspace{5mm}}}{\\boxed{\\rule{0pt}{5mm}\\hspace{5mm}}}\\times\\frac{\\boxed{\\rule{0pt}{5mm}\\hspace{5mm}}}{\\boxed{\\rule{0pt}{5mm}\\hspace{5mm}}}\\\\[3mm]&=\\frac{\\boxed{\\rule{0pt}{5mm}\\hspace{5mm}}}{\\boxed{\\rule{0pt}{5mm}\\hspace{5mm}}}\\end{aligned}",
